		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[KIA Subtitle Example]]></title>
			<link>https://sandbox.lndo.site/2024/03/29/kia-subtitle-example/</link>
			<pubDate>Fri, 29 Mar 2024 19:29:35 +0000</pubDate>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[helga]]></dc:creator>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">https://sandbox.lndo.site/?p=2286</guid>
			<description></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you look the Post sidebar in the block editor, you should see an input for Subtitle. In this example the value is "An insightful subtitle".</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"large"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://github.com/helgatheviking/KIA-Subtitle/blob/trunk/.wordpress-org/screenshot-1.png?raw=true" alt=""/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>This plugin does not automatically handle the display on the front end. To achieve this you can either:</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Modify your site editor templates</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>specifically the singular and archive templates. In this example you should be able to see the subtitle block already inserted if you <a href="/wp-admin/site-editor.php?postType=wp_template&amp;postId=twentytwentyfour%2F%2Fsingle">visit the Site Editor for single posts.</a><br><br>If you are viewing this post on the front end, you should see the subtitle directly underneath the post title.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Modify your classic theme templates using template tags</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Everything is different so it's difficult to say exactly which file needs to be updated. And if you are using someone else's theme, you might need a child theme to make your changes.  The two template tags are:</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><code>if ( function_exists( 'the_subtitle' ) ) the_subtitle( '&lt;h2 class="subtitle">', '&lt;/h2>' );</code></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>or</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><code>echo get_the_subtitle();</code></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
